  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid quantum–classical fraud detection model using a 16‑qubit angle‑encoded Qiskit circuit combined with classical neural networks. Evaluated on the Credit Card Fraud Detection dataset (284,807 transactions), the model reports 0.92 overall accuracy with fraud-class precision 0.65 and recall 0.68, using simulated circuits with average depth ≈7.3. No explicit classical baseline results or runtime comparisons are provided.",
